From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:38:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 151/159] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: Add the q6voice services

Add the MVM, CVS and CVP voice services of the audio DSP, with the
voice DAIs under MVM, for modem call audio. They are disabled by
default.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250.dtsi | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 28 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250.dtsi
index 653f838a96c8..f0870dbb1469 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250.dtsi
@@ -1329,6 +1329,34 @@ q6routing: routing {
 							#sound-dai-cells = <0>;
 						};
 					};
+
+					q6mvm: service@9 {
+						compatible = "qcom,q6mvm";
+						reg = <APR_SVC_ADSP_MVM>;
+						qcom,protection-domain = "avs/audio", "msm/adsp/audio_pd";
+						status = "disabled";
+
+						q6voicedai: dais {
+							compatible = "qcom,q6voice-dais";
+							#address-cells = <1>;
+							#size-cells = <0>;
+							#sound-dai-cells = <1>;
+						};
+					};
+
+					q6cvs: service@a {
+						compatible = "qcom,q6cvs";
+						reg = <APR_SVC_ADSP_CVS>;
+						qcom,protection-domain = "avs/audio", "msm/adsp/audio_pd";
+						status = "disabled";
+					};
+
+					q6cvp: service@b {
+						compatible = "qcom,q6cvp";
+						reg = <APR_SVC_ADSP_CVP>;
+						qcom,protection-domain = "avs/audio", "msm/adsp/audio_pd";
+						status = "disabled";
+					};
 				};
 			};
 		};
